/* The application manifest of xc3.exe (xc3.manifest) and its icon (xc3.ico, also the icon of XC3-Setup.exe and of
   the installer window). tools/build_game.py compiles it with the runtime objects. It is not in libxc3rt.a: the
   installer compiles it per install with the game's own icon in place of xc3.ico (build_game.py --icon). */
1 24 "xc3.manifest"
1 ICON "xc3.ico"
